cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "HiSem-VRAG: Hierarchical Semantic Retrieval for Long-Form Video Question Answering"
abstract: >-
  Code for VRAG, a hierarchical coarse-to-fine retrieval-augmented framework for
  question answering over long-form instructional videos. Videos are organized as
  Video, Topics, Scenes and Frames, and retrieval narrows the search space one level
  at a time.
